<title>USA: PALFED board reaffirms co's business plan.</title>
<headline>PALFED board reaffirms co's business plan.</headline>
<dateline>AIKEN, S.C. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PALFED Inc said Wednesday that, in response to a non-binding shareholder resolution calling for the sale of the company, the board reaffirmed its current business plan to remain independent and build its franchise value.</p>
<p>PALFED said it has no plan to enter into an auction.</p>
</text>
